WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.160
Genesis says the imagination of
man's heart is evil from his youth.

2
00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:09.760
Yet the same book says every
human is made in the image of God.

3
00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:13.420
The rabbis taught that every
person has two inclinations:

4
00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:16.480
one towards evil, one towards good.

5
00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:20.960
If every person has an urge to do wrong,
why did the rabbis say that urge can

6
00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:23.180
also build a house?

7
00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:26.140
In this mission, you'll
see what Jews hope for:

8
00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:29.190
the Messianic Age, and the world to come.

9
00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:32.970
Then you'll discover the 613
commandments of the Torah,

10
00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:35.310
and how Jewish groups differ on them.

11
00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:40.520
Your mission: find out why the rabbis
said that urge can also build a house.
